<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">ABOUT</div>
    <h1>Technology With a Human Purpose.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Bachelor of Business Administration graduate, civic-technology entrepreneur and youth-development advocate from Nepal.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <img src="/images/tedx-portrait.jpg" alt="Sujina Dahal portrait on a TEDx stage">
        <div class="profile-tags">
          <span class="tag">Civic-Technology Entrepreneur</span>
          <span class="tag">Digital Literacy Trainer</span>
          <span class="tag">SDG &amp; M&amp;E Coordinator</span>
          <span class="tag">Researcher</span>
          <span class="tag">Youth Leader</span>
          <span class="tag">Stakeholder Coordinator</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>I am a Bachelor of Business Administration graduate, civic-technology entrepreneur and youth-development advocate from Nepal. My work combines research, digital literacy, public-service innovation, programme coordination and community leadership.</p>
        <p>I founded Prashasan Pro to address a practical problem: citizens often struggle to find clear, accurate and reliable information about administrative procedures such as citizenship and passport applications. The platform's website is live, and an app is being developed to make public-service information easier to access and understand.</p>
        <p>Alongside entrepreneurship, I have coordinated SDG outreach across 11 districts, trained more than 2,000 students in AI literacy and online safety, supported research communication, delivered community programmes, and worked with youth and civic organizations. My approach is simple: understand the problem, listen to the people affected, use evidence responsibly and build solutions that create public value.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="num">What I Do</div>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Where I Create Value.</h2>
      <p class="lede">I combine business knowledge, applied research, community experience and technology-focused problem solving to move ideas from public need to practical action.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cap-list">
      <div class="cap"><div class="cap-index">01</div><div><h3>Civic Technology &amp; Digital Public Services</h3><p>Developing accessible digital solutions that help citizens understand and navigate public-service procedures, including citizenship and passport information.</p></div></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="cap-index">02</div><div><h3>Digital Literacy &amp; Responsible AI</h3><p>Designing and delivering learning sessions on AI literacy, online safety, digital footprints, misinformation and disinformation.</p></div></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="cap-index">03</div><div><h3>SDG Programme Coordination &amp; M&amp;E</h3><p>Coordinating outreach, collecting monitoring data and preparing reports that connect local activities with wider development goals.</p></div></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="cap-index">04</div><div><h3>Research &amp; Evidence</h3><p>Conducting applied quantitative and qualitative research to understand behaviour, public needs and programme outcomes.</p></div></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="cap-index">05</div><div><h3>Youth Leadership &amp; Civic Engagement</h3><p>Creating spaces where young people, women and communities can learn, participate, share ideas and contribute to solutions.</p></div></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="cap-index">06</div><div><h3>Communication &amp; Stakeholder Engagement</h3><p>Turning complex ideas into clear outreach materials, reports, presentations, digital content and partnerships.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
